## Technical Implementation & Web Platform APIs

- **Candidate-Focused Spatial Attention**: Blends raw Transformer feature map activations with a 2D Gaussian spatial mask calculated from candidate bounding box coordinates to isolate attention hotspots from background terrain.
- **[Canvas API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Canvas_API)**: Used in `frontend/index.html` to render a 60 FPS animated 3D-perspective solar system with dynamic radial gradients and orbital ellipses (`ctx.ellipse`, `ctx.createRadialGradient`).
- **[Fetch API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fetch_API)**: Executes asynchronous HTTP POST and GET requests for multipart form upload (`/api/detect`) and JSON telemetry endpoints (`/api/experiments/*`).
- **[URL.createObjectURL()](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/URL/createObjectURL_static)**: Generates instant client-side image previews for user-uploaded Mars images without waiting for server round-trips.
- **[FormData API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FormData)**: Encapsulates image files uploaded from input elements for binary transmission via multipart form data.
- **[Node.js Child Process (`spawn`)](https://nodejs.org/api/child_process.html#child_processspawncommand-args-options)**: Asynchronously launches the Uvicorn Python FastAPI process on an automatically assigned free port.

