| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Python 3.10+** | Core AI pipeline and service execution | [python.org](https://www.python.org/) |
| **PyTorch** | Deep learning framework for detector and verifier models | [pytorch.org](https://pytorch.org/) |
| **FastAPI** | High-performance asynchronous REST API backend (`backend/app.py`) | [fastapi.tiangolo.com](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/) |
| **Uvicorn** | ASGI server implementation serving the FastAPI application | [uvicorn.org](https://www.uvicorn.org/) |
| **OpenCV (`cv2`)** | Image processing, morphological filtering, and colormap generation | [opencv.org](https://opencv.org/) |
| **Pillow (PIL)** | Image conversion, formatting, and JPEG encoding | [python-pillow.org](https://python-pillow.org/) |

